        summary: 'Very common festival combination. Cannabis can intensify the psychedelic character of MDMA and amplify anxiety. Timing matters significantly, cannabis at the MDMA peak is riskier than during the comedown.',
        mechanism: 'THC amplifies serotonergic effects and sensory processing through CB1 receptor activation. At MDMA peak, this can push an already-intense experience toward anxiety or panic, particularly in less-experienced users or with high-THC products.',
