        summary: 'A candy flip combines MDMA and LSD for a 12–18 hour experience. LSD extends the duration dramatically. Combined serotonergic load and prolonged physiological stress substantially increase recovery requirements and neurotoxicity risk.',
        mechanism: 'LSD activates 5-HT2A, 5-HT2C, and other serotonin receptors for 8–12 hours. Adding MDMA\'s serotonin flood during this window creates a prolonged state of high serotonergic activity. Extended cardiovascular strain over 12+ hours is significant.',
        advice: 'Time MDMA 3–4 hours into the LSD experience so peaks align. Keep MDMA at 75mg or less. Stay cool and hydrated. Recovery period should be double your usual MDMA spacing, at minimum 3 months if following harm reduction guidelines.',
