        mechanism: 'MAOIs inhibit breakdown of serotonin and may reduce LSD metabolism, leading to dramatically higher effective concentrations. The experience can become unmanageable even at doses normally considered moderate.',
        advice: 'Avoid. If on prescribed MAOIs, do not use psychedelics. In traditional ceremonial contexts, practitioners work with fractions of what might be considered a recreational dose, always with an experienced guide present.',
