        mechanism: 'Cocaine triggers massive norepinephrine and dopamine release via reuptake inhibition. MAOIs prevent catecholamine breakdown, sustaining a hypertensive state that can reach stroke-level blood pressure.',
        advice: 'Do not combine under any circumstances. This is a life-threatening interaction. Severe headache, chest pain, or vision changes after combining these substances require immediate emergency care.',
        emergency: true
