        mechanism: 'Tramadol\'s mu-opioid agonism depresses respiratory drive. Benzos add GABA-A mediated brainstem depression. The combination is synergistic rather than merely additive.',
        advice: 'Use extreme caution if both are prescribed. Do not exceed prescribed doses of either. Avoid alcohol as a third CNS depressant. Have naloxone available, it will partially reverse the opioid component of tramadol overdose.',
        emergency: false
      },
      [key('tramadol','alcohol')]: {
